@startuml
!include style.iuml
hide empty description
state "Not Asked" as NotAsked
state "Granted" as Granted
state "Not Granted" as NotGranted
state "Re-consent Required" as Reconsent
[*] --> NotAsked
NotAsked --> Granted : user accepts\n/ record consent
NotAsked --> NotGranted : user declines\n/ record decision
Granted --> NotGranted : user withdraws\n/ record withdrawal
NotGranted --> Granted : user accepts\n/ record consent
Granted --> Reconsent : new text version published
Reconsent --> Granted : user accepts new version
Reconsent --> NotGranted : user declines
note bottom of NotGranted
healthData: tracking features unavailable.
trainingPhotos: photos are not stored.
end note
@enduml
